{"kind":{"type":"paragraph"},"runs":[{"text":"Rebuild and Relaunch spins forever at preflight","style":[],"link":{"destination":"unbounded-preflight-probe-spins-with-no-step-log.md","title":null},"image":false},{"text":" — the same class of bug one layer up: an unbounded out-of-process wait with no way to see or stop it. That one bounded a probe; this one bounds a socket.","style":[],"link":null,"image":false}],"quoteDepth":0,"listDepth":1,"marker":"bullet"},
